---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FeasibilitySurvey from '../components/FeasibilitySurvey.vue';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<Layout title="P4A Feasability Survey">
  <main>
    <div class="container pt-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <header class="mb-8">
          <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl text-p4a-bg1 font-bold">Playbook for America – Feasibility Survey</h1>
          <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed">
            We are Investigating the desirability and viability of the Playbook for America (P4A) web platform.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed">
            The Playbook for America (P4A) exists to bring together ideas and programs that improve government, strengthen democracy, and renew civic life in the United States.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed">
            Organized as a nonpartisan nonprofit, P4A operates an online platform where citizens and government officials can crowdsource, discuss, and rank ideas and programs, with a focus on turning the most promising ones into actionable solutions. Our aim is to elevate the best ideas from all corners of the nation and help move them toward real-world impact.
          </p>
        </header>
        
      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-8 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">This is how it works</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <!-- Every contribution fits into a clear path forward. Issues define problems, Ideas propose solutions, and Playbooks turn promising ideas into action and outcomes. -->
          Playbook for America is built around three connected building blocks. Issues define problems. Ideas propose solutions. 
          Playbooks turn strong ideas into coordinated action and measurable outcomes.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr] items-stretch gap-2">
          <div class="bg-p4a-body rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-bg1">
            <div class="bg-p4a-bg1 py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:hand-palm" /> Issue</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">A clearly defined public problem that deserves attention, understanding, and action.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 hidden md:block" name="ph:arrow-right-bold" />
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 md:hidden" name="ph:arrow-down-bold" />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-p4a-body rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-bg1">
            <div class="bg-p4a-bg1 py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:lightbulb" /> Idea</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">A proposed solution to an Issue which is ready to be discussed, improved, and strengthened.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 hidden md:block" name="ph:arrow-right-bold" />
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 md:hidden" name="ph:arrow-down-bold" />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-p4a-body rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-bg1">
            <div class="bg-p4a-bg1 py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:book-open-text" /> Playbook</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">An execution-ready plan that turns strong Ideas into coordinated action, ownership, and measurable results.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>


        <section class="mb-14">
          <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed">
            Please take a moment to complete the survey. It's anonymous unless you choose to share your email. (Other entries are required.)
          </p>
          <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <FeasibilitySurvey client:load />
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
